# Ping Pong Palace (levels/solo/pingpong.txt), the no-call route: as the Giant Steps route up
# the chimney, no call. Off the runway's end into the cellar, back left under the landing to
# the nugget and the secret, then the cellar: a hole, low hops under the cushion ceiling
# (jump high and it slams you into the drink), two ducks, up the elevator and toot through
# its hatch. At the merge the tunnel: low hops over its holes, the kicker, the duck shaft.
